Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:44.00,0:01:44.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:15.05,0:03:15.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:12:35.15,0:12:35.19,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:23.07,0:22:23.11,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:53.08,0:23:53.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"LuluttoLilly"?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's your unit name. I came up with it myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.59,0:00:29.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The time, December.\NThe venue, ZeppoCity in Odaiba.{play on Zepp DiverCity hence lack of space}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.47,0:00:31.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The capacity, around 3,000!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.89,0:00:34.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, where's your reaction...?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I-It {\i1}is{\i0} amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.93,0:00:40.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I've only just made my debut...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.73,0:00:42.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Same for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.73,0:00:46.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's true. It is a bit ambitious\Nfor your first concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But look at this.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.40,0:00:53.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Your actions up to now have brought lots of fans. 
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone{\i0} wants to see you perform.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.87,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Get that crack fixed already.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.33,0:01:01.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But more importantly, {\i1}I{\i0} want to see it too.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.38,0:01:07.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Compared to other agencies,\Nwe're smaller and have a lot less money.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.96,0:01:10.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But we make up for that in passion!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I will arrange the concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez will handle marketing!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.10,0:01:16.10,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.10,0:01:18.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena will choreograph!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly and Lulu, you'll give your all practicing!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.35,0:01:22.19,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.19,0:01:26.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We'll spare no effort to make this concert a success...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No, to make this concert go down in legend!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.03,0:01:33.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Once...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,More-More!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.70,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,More-More!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.17,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,When did you come up with that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.48,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Rui, Fuu, you two have been coming home\Nawfully late recently.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.27,0:03:28.27,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Don't act surprised, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.82,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,I get worried when it's dark out\Nand you're still not home!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.82,0:03:34.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What've you been getting up to after school?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.36,0:03:40.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Even elementary schoolers\Ncan be pretty busy, y'know?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.33,0:03:42.45,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,What about you, Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, I...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.70,0:03:47.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's new. You don't go out often, big sis.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.54,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Neither do you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.09,0:03:58.59,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Girls, starting tomorrow your curfew is 6:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.59,0:04:01.35,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,If you break it, you'll be grounded for one month.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.35,0:04:02.51,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.51,0:04:03.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.10,0:04:06.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A curfew...?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.64,0:04:10.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, how do I get past them?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.40,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Give up?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then I can't be an idol!\NI'll have to retire!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.57,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,But then you can laze around.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna laze around!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.28,0:04:20.53,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,How about magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I dunno if my magic will work...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.70,0:04:24.83,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,'Cuz you stink.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.00,0:04:29.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I guess it'll be fine if I come back\Nbefore the shop closes...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Get out of school, take the train,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,do my practice, take the train back.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.96,0:04:38.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,If I'm quick, I can make it work!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.51,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.43,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Rise.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.02,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Bow.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.02,0:04:47.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.06,Default,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.23,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Nonoyama-san, no running!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.77,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Fuu-chan's fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.99,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Don't shake so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.99,0:05:10.62,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Y'know, doing a concert\Nmakes me feel like a real idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.62,0:05:11.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.00,0:05:16.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,If I secretly give big sis a ticket,\Nmaybe she'll come to see me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I figured we should use\Na moving cart for the performance!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.64,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A moving cart?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It feels a lot like an idol concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.31,0:05:28.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, you {\i1}are{\i0} an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.81,0:05:30.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.94,0:05:33.60,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Do idols normally handcraft their stages?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.60,0:05:38.61,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Between the venue rental and the staff labor,\Nwe're already dry in funds.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.69,0:05:42.70,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We'll have to use our passion to cover the rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We cannot fail!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.12,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.45,0:05:52.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's okay! We have extra.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.88,0:05:58.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly's here. You go to dance practice.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good work today!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.97,0:06:06.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.80,0:06:08.68,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It's almost curfew.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.68,0:06:10.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.03,0:06:19.94,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.86,0:06:23.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm safe! Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.74,0:06:24.82,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.12,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Go take a bath, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.58,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You're good.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.92,0:06:35.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Tohre!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.14,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.14,0:06:46.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I feel so unsteady.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.31,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Unsteady?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.10,0:06:55.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I've never sung in front of so many people before.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.10,0:06:59.07,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to sing again, Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.65,0:07:00.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.07,0:07:06.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But can I reach other people with it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.33,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I like your singing!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.62,0:07:13.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you, Azuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.70,0:07:16.29,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,By the way, will you make it before curfew?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Oh! My curfew!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.71,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Just don't push yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I won't! It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.72,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Alright, got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.50,0:08:01.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Magic has helped me...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}get stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Barely made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.18,0:08:17.06,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Everyday's been so busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's pretty empty, so here will do.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.86,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.86,0:08:26.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Saving some time!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.45,0:08:32.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula! Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.67,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly, you're a bit fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.51,0:08:48.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Want to try that part one more time?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.01,0:08:50.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.51,0:08:54.06,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Oh, you two okay with time?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.06,0:08:54.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh no! I gotta get home soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I want to practice some more.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.66,0:09:12.62,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.28,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.28,0:09:16.58,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I-I'm home!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.04,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.00,0:09:19.91,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Fuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.00,0:09:23.08,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Rui?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.67,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Are they upstairs already?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.30,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Dinner will be ready soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.17,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,We're gonna take a bath first!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.51,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm going first!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.10,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Their voices sound weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.55,0:09:38.10,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Good work. You two have shown\Na lot of improvement.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.02,0:09:40.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm beat!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm glad you think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But I have to keep working on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The concert's almost here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.36,0:09:48.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.15,0:09:52.11,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Both of you get some good rest tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Uguisu...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.92,0:10:11.17,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,They're working our paws off...{play on 人使いが荒い}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.17,0:10:12.59,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.06,0:10:19.93,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.93,0:10:21.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, try getting in!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,H-How's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It feels so satisfying now that it's done!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.23,0:10:35.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I-I guess it is satisfying,\Nbut are they really gonna ride on this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.24,0:10:39.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. What matters most\Nin a situation like this is we give it our all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.58,0:10:44.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a bit amateurish on the outside,\Nbut the fans will love it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.37,0:10:49.96,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,When you put it that way,\NI guess I can see it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.59,0:10:54.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I have a meeting, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.05,0:10:56.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, Lulu, you keep practicing today!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena, I'll leave the lesson to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.85,0:11:00.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.52,0:11:03.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You got changed fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.15,0:11:18.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It looks a lot bigger than I thought from this angle...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is that cart gonna work here...?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Eh, it'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.46,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Can we bring in the set on the day of the show?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yes, that'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Everything's looking great.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.18,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.31,0:11:46.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, let's try this part again...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.57,0:11:53.32,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.69,0:11:56.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to make bigger movements!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.65,0:12:00.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to give my all doing everything I can!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.71,0:12:10.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, what...?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.13,0:12:15.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.43,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She has a fever.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.76,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly, bring some water! And a towel!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's strange.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.27,0:12:30.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm supposed to be able to do\Nanything when I'm Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least I thought so...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.82,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I think her weariness got to her.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.70,0:12:43.53,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We'll bring her to the hospital.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.29,0:12:48.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll continue practice soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.16,0:12:51.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You can't, Lulu-chan!\NWe're wrapping up for the day.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.71,0:12:58.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I hardly have any days where I can\Npractice hard all day long.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.38,0:13:03.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's true we're short on time.\NBut it'll be fruitless if you collapse.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.89,0:13:06.89,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'll make the dance a bit easier for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please let me try again.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.48,0:13:12.23,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're not listening to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.07,0:13:23.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The venue is amazing! I'm so pumped!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I ran into a fan on the way back,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.83,0:13:28.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,and they're super excited for the con...cert...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena, what happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.71,0:13:39.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu collapsed. She has a slight fever.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.05,0:13:42.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is an order: please rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.35,0:13:52.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There's a difference between\Nworking hard and pushing yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.15,0:13:55.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's not what the fans want.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.70,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I pushed you too hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.99,0:14:06.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, you didn't...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Can you make it home alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're not gonna try to get extra practice in, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good work today.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.84,0:14:25.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.18,0:14:31.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Y'know, while I like seeing you work hard,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.10,0:14:37.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think everyone wants to see you\Nsinging the way you usually do.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The way I usually do?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.73,0:14:44.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah. When I first saw you singing, I thought...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"She must really love singing!"
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.03,0:14:52.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You just looked like singing had set you free.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.25,0:14:56.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I figure that's the kind of Lulu-chan\Neveryone wants to see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's what I want too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I do like to sing.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But that was the only thing I had thought about.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Is that a bad thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.01,0:15:12.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. There's more to it for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.86,0:15:20.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Well, I should go.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.95,0:15:27.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'll be okay, Lulu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can actually use magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.33,0:15:36.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll cast a spell for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Like, "May Lulu-chan be able\Nto perform with no worries!"
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.43,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,It's still a bit high.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.18,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Do you think you can eat lunch?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.44,0:16:00.48,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,I'll leave it in the kitchen for you, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.15,0:16:04.44,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Azuki, let's go and let big sis rest, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.28,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How's big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.71,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,She's resting well.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.71,0:16:21.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lulu-chan had a cold too.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's been spreading around at school.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.76,0:16:26.92,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.57,0:16:49.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.28,0:16:50.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be resting?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I need to get my homework done.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You really should rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I know, but I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lulu-chan and big sis are so stubborn!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.13,0:17:11.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, since they're so weird in the same way...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.10,0:17:14.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll do something to help you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can actually use magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.94,0:17:25.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.04,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,If they find out...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.45,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,you'll get scolded!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.91,0:17:41.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll make this quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.39,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.48,0:18:04.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let big sis—and Lulu-chan—
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.19,0:18:09.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,rest calmly without anyone getting in their way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.51,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's... snowing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.77,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.73,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Could this be Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.07,0:18:51.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Magic...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.78,0:18:54.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san said the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.28,0:18:59.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is magic spreading around or something?{counterpart line to 16:21, this feels more like "trending"/"popular" use of hayatteru but it's important it uses the same word as the prior line so i have to strike a balance}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.33,0:19:04.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.97,0:19:21.43,Default,Weatherman,0,0,0,,Late last night, Tokyo had\Na sudden heavy snowfall.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.93,Default,Weatherman,0,0,0,,It's currently continuing to snow...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.98,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's a lot of snow, especially for fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.40,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you get home?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.90,0:19:32.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She's calling you over again, isn't she?{implied callback to mom calling in ep 5}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.49,0:19:37.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I heard the trains aren't gonna move in this snow.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.20,0:19:42.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Besides, the concert's more important.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.04,0:19:46.33,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The songs are fantastic, their vocals are great,\Nand they're hard at work on their dancing.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.75,0:19:49.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,All that's left is for us to give them a push.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.00,0:19:49.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.46,0:19:54.42,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Wasn't being an idol your dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.47,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Don't {\i1}you{\i0} want to be on stage?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.43,0:20:03.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Once the agency takes off,\NI'll have plenty of opportunities.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.44,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Playing tough, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.27,0:20:09.02,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,But what if it doesn't take off?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.57,0:20:13.98,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I just do.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.98,0:20:17.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But I think everything will work out.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.03,0:20:21.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.25,0:20:30.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Today's practice was canceled due to snowfall.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.63,0:20:33.30,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Really? What about school?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Should be off, probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.13,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.14,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Now you can rest easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.14,0:20:41.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Out of season snow...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,could this be someone's magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.03,0:20:57.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.55,0:21:25.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Apologies for the concern!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.31,0:21:28.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan! You're back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.35,0:21:30.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, this ended up being\Na good time to refresh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.44,0:21:36.44,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Thanks to that snowfall.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! I feel ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.45,0:21:44.07,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Oh, good. Everyone's here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.07,0:21:46.91,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I finished the poster for the concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.75,0:21:52.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Looking at it like this makes me feel nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.37,0:21:53.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Don't you feel happy?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm really excited!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.89,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Now, not much time before the concert!\NSo let's get to practice!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.89,0:22:09.72,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.48,0:22:13.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lulutto...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.11,0:22:17.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.23,0:22:21.53,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}our very first concert!
Comment: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:20.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly Proposal (Confidential)
